\begin_layout Subsection
Simple If-Acceleration with a Fixed Core
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
In response to the lost protective effect xxx of the TED above a certain
 complexity, a fixed core was defined which only allows evolutions to affect
 the condition.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The forced distinction between action 0 and 2 is no real drawback, but since
 the SARSA policies both choose action 1, the regression error can no longer
 be reduced to 0.
 The regression error still drops to 
\begin_inset ERT
status open

